---
title: Proposed Forge asset pipeline - load and activate
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant W as World loader
    participant R as Asset registry
    participant F as Byte source
    participant T as Tick scheduler
    Note over W,T: Proposed load sequence
    W->>R: Request level by stable asset ID
    R->>R: Resolve cooked locator
    Note over W,T: Active cooked output first, then the configured alternate location.
    R->>F: Read with epoch and retained buffer
    F-->>R: Completion and buffer
    R->>R: Check the level epoch
    Note over W,T: Drop stale completion and release its buffer.
    R->>R: Verify digest and required assets
    Note over W,T: Required failure keeps the active level.<br/>Missing optional atlas uses primitives.
    R->>R: Initialize validated assets
    R->>T: Stage level with manifest identity
    T->>R: Record activation tick and publish
    T-->>W: Activate the validated level
